  "goodToKnow": "Der Abgang is an exit or departure: ein würdiger Abgang (a dignified exit), der Abgang des Ministers. On stage, it's an exit; in gymnastics, the dismount. Casually, einen Abgang machen means to clear off. In wine tasting, der Abgang is the finish, the aftertaste. Schulabgänger are school-leavers. From abgehen (to go off, leave). Plural: die Abgänge."
